{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25722","headline":"客思吟 · 杨敬之","name":"客思吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禾黍正离离，南园剪白芝。\n细腰沈赵女，高髻唱蛮姬。\n路愧前冈月，梳惭一颔丝。\n乡人不可语，独念畏人知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨敬之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}